      "mergeID": "696a66a92bb88ccf00ec478c",
      "mergedPostDetails": "I am not sure if anyone else is seeing this issue with notifications but I mute most group notifications because some spam and it can get annoying. I have been getting notifications lately on mobile to join groups that I have muted and even join groups I am not even a part of… \n\nI keep getting these notifications I even found and joined the group just to mute it and leave and I am still getting notifications. Does anyone have a fix to this or has anyone else seen group notifications on mobile when you shouldn’t have any.",
