      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is what is happening… I have never gone to this group prior nor do I have friends in this group it is also creepy this is showing up on my page as I do not want to hang out with minors. So having this “teen chill out” spam makes me want to just remove app notifications entirely —- update as of today 12/17/2025 I have blocked the group and I’m still getting requests to join this group instance",
