  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I have disabled some groups announcements since they are somewhat... spammy. But these settings will not apply on iOS build since they still come thru. I do not get notifications in-game, not on VRC website nor VRCX.\n\nSteps to reproduce:\n\n1. Mute group announcements\n\n2. Send announcement on said group (can be your own group, this happens with any and all groups)\n\n3. iOS gets notification about it, your in-game nor website does not.\n\niOS view: https://prism.roitec.fi/share/kUjqF1Ny1Y59WjV-qbU6VEqKSXnYq0vPtKiesx-DhEoPKy0PFIEabKiP1Q2yOYJwvIE\n\nWeb view: http://idrank.poisoned.coffee/u/QNQYTO.png\n\nVRCX view: https://idrank.poisoned.coffee/u/xWqE1I.png\n\nVideo:\n\niOS POV: https://prism.roitec.fi/share/DubD6lyFD6BFv6olmzpa96QUa9zmGa7pgXJHFZt_lxJUAQGFTB4FgvhZzxUqX0KDtHw\n\nComputer POV: https://idrank.poisoned.coffee/u/WdhoGW.gif",
